VS Code Extension Module
Overview

The VS Code Extension is the user interaction layer of the Wizard framework. It allows developers to access Wizard's verification features directly from Visual Studio Code without manually executing commands. The extension converts user requests into executable commands, sends them to the backend AI agent system, and displays the generated results. It also updates the project documentation automatically, making the workflow simple, consistent, and reproducible.

