Core Capabilities
Provides a simple interface inside VS Code.
Automatically generates Wizard commands.
Communicates with the backend AI agent system.
Displays execution results.
Updates README and EVD automatically.
Supports Screenshot, JSON, CSS, and Accessibility tasks.
Role of the Extension in Wizard

The VS Code Extension acts as the interface between the user and the Wizard backend. It does not perform AI reasoning or verification itself. Instead, it translates user requests into executable commands, communicates with the backend, receives the results, and documents the complete execution process, making Wizard easier to use and improving developer productivity.
